<div class="page-head">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">StockChief</p><h1>Help and support</h1><p class="lede">Start with the task you were trying to complete. StockChief keeps the business evidence and audit history needed to investigate it.</p></div>
</div>
<% if(locals.supportAccess?.isOperator){ %><section class="card card-body"><h2>Your customer support desk</h2><p>Read customer requests and reply yourself. Choose when you are available for live chat.</p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/commercial-admin/support">Open your Support desk</a></section><% } %><% if(locals.supportAccess){const a=supportAccess.agreement; %><section class="card card-body"><h2><%= supportAccess.chat?'Priority support conversations':supportAccess.priority?'Priority email support':'Email support' %></h2><p>Open a request below and continue the conversation here. You can also reply to support@stockchiefhq.com.</p><% if(a){ %><h3><%= a.status==='ACTIVE'?'Your agreed services':'Service agreement for your review' %></h3><p style="white-space:pre-wrap"><%= a.service_text %></p><% if(a.manager_name){ %><p>Account manager: <%= a.manager_name %> · <%= a.manager_email %></p><% } %><% if(a.response_hours){ %><p>First-response target: <%= a.response_hours %> elapsed hours after a new request.</p><% } %><% if(a.status==='PREPARED'&&a.owner_account_id===account.id){ %><form method="post" action="/support/agreement/accept"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= a.revision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I accept these exact service terms.</label><button class="btn" type="submit">Accept service agreement</button></form><% } %><% } %></section><% } %>

<section class="card card-body stack">
  <h2>Get help</h2>
  <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/guide">Open the step-by-step guide</a></p>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/activity">Open Activity and audit history</a></p>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/settings/connections">Check connection health</a></p>
  <p>Support email: <strong>support@stockchiefhq.com</strong></p>
</section>
<% if(locals.supportRequestKey){ %><%- include('partials/support-form') %><% } %>

<section class="card card-body stack">
  <h2>When something looks wrong</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open <strong>Needs you</strong> for the exact missing decision or evidence.</li>
    <li>Open <strong>Activity</strong> to see what happened, who or what recorded it, and when.</li>
    <li>Do not repeat a supplier payment, receipt, or stock action just because a page timed out. StockChief’s duplicate protection will preserve the first result.</li>
    <li>Include the visible PO, Sales Order, invoice, connection, or event reference when contacting support. Never send passwords, OAuth secrets, or API keys.</li>
  </ol>
</section>
